1
00:00:00,307 --> 00:00:02,707
(Sheldon:)Perhaps.

2
00:00:02,710 --> 00:00:05,680
(Sheldon:)But my mom made me spaghetti
with chopped-up hot dogs

3
00:00:05,679 --> 00:00:08,409
(Sheldon:)whenever I wanted,
so who cares?

4
00:00:10,583 --> 00:00:14,323
(Leonard:)Not once did my mother ever
give me any love or affection

5
00:00:14,321 --> 00:00:16,421
for just being myself;
I always had to earn it.

6
00:00:16,423 --> 00:00:17,523
(Mrs Cooper:)Oh, Leonard,

7
00:00:17,524 --> 00:00:19,994
(Mrs Cooper:)I'm sure she loves you
very much.

8
00:00:19,994 --> 00:00:23,594
(Mrs Cooper:)In her own cold godless way.

9
00:00:23,597 --> 00:00:27,437
(Penny:)Yeah, and you certainly don't
have to earn my love.

10
00:00:27,434 --> 00:00:28,664
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

11
00:00:28,669 --> 00:00:29,939
(Mrs Cooper:)Of course,
you already knew that

12
00:00:29,937 --> 00:00:33,877
(Penny:)when you bought me
this princess-cut drill bit.

13
00:00:33,874 --> 00:00:35,944
(Leonard:)That's not what it is.

14
00:00:35,943 --> 00:00:37,773
(Penny:)I know, I know.

15
00:00:37,778 --> 00:00:40,008
(imitates drill buzzing)

16
00:00:40,014 --> 00:00:42,784
(Mrs Cooper:)When your mom gets back,
I'm gonna need

17
00:00:42,783 --> 00:00:44,913
(Mrs Cooper:)to apologize for the way
I spoke to her.

18
00:00:44,919 --> 00:00:46,889
(Penny:)Well, come on now,
she did kind of start it.

19
00:00:46,887 --> 00:00:49,717
Doesn't matter; a good Christian
would've turned the other cheek.

20
00:00:49,723 --> 00:00:50,893
(Mrs Cooper:)On the other hand,

21
00:00:50,891 --> 00:00:53,661
(Mrs Cooper:)a good Texan
would've shot her, so...

22
00:00:56,362 --> 00:00:59,102
(Mrs Cooper:)I just kind of
split the difference.

23
00:00:59,099 --> 00:01:02,139
(Mrs Cooper:)Hey, who's in the mood
for spaghetti and hot dogs?

